# This project deploys the marketing site living at the repo root
# (momentumdatasolutions.com). Exclude everything that isn't part
# of that static build.

# NOTE: app/ (the separate Next.js/Supabase platform at
# app.momentumdatasolutions.com — see app/README.md) is intentionally NOT
# excluded here. Both this marketing-site project and the app/ project
# read this SAME root .vercelignore file. Excluding app/ kept breaking
# the app project's own build (it deletes the exact files that project's
# Root Directory build depends on) — first by matching app/src/app/ (the
# Next.js App Router directory) when unanchored, then by matching the
# app/ folder itself even anchored. Leaving app/ present in the marketing
# site's static deploy is harmless (nothing references those files); the
# app project needing them is not.

# Superseded starter snapshot — the current build lives at the repo root.
/momentum_data_homepage_client_login/

# Backups / archives, not meant to be served.
momentum-data-current-complete-services-client-portal.zip
momentum-home-backup.html
/archive/

# Internal docs and editor/OS cruft. Anchored to repo root — app/ has its
# own docs feature (app/src/app/(dashboard)/docs/) that must NOT match here.
/docs/
/.vscode/
.DS_Store
